  <section class="card">
    <h2>Data Flows &amp; Controls</h2>
    <ul class="flowlist">
      <li>Clients reach <code>normain.com</code> via <b>Cloudflare DNS</b> over <b>HTTPS</b>.</li>
      <li>Traffic enters the <b>Azure Load Balancer</b> on <b>HTTPS&nbsp;443</b>.</li>
      <li>LB &rarr; <b>Istio Ingress Gateway</b> (TLS termination) in the AKS cluster.</li>
      <li>Gateway &rarr; <b>App workloads</b> (api + worker, per tenant).</li>
      <li>App &rarr; <b>PostgreSQL Flexible Server</b> &amp; <b>Managed Redis</b> over the private VNet.</li>
      <li>App &rarr; <b>Key Vault</b> &amp; <b>Storage</b> (blob + NFS) via service endpoints.</li>
      <li>App &rarr; <b>Azure OpenAI + Doc Intelligence</b> (EU regions) over HTTPS.</li>
      <li>AKS pulls images from the <b>Container Registry</b> (<code>rg-normain-global</code>).</li>
    </ul>
